dXmQX80Q7kNvwHMCTdp&_nc_oc=AdrX474rCy1r71XJbd6DOM06KBS2F7xLhm2NgBvOxjDZ4cIi6cO5DmMyS2E3i67oBv8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA6FVFTalzzJETmDy6CZazsSrCNemQouXG0RPmJNh4sLw&oe=6A511754"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "649512930873901", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618484_649512934207234_7095113286224355206_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AFAqhwBCTvsQ7kNvwEaYIuD&_nc_oc=AdquU0QeAoeKVpNbjE0YZKGcRlt-yMIH-GYQMc-tAuSthIyjDPFtLY4eQ-pf-WEy-es&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQChr52h1o1KJOkJaozDiWA7dC8gJPMTd3u0Kqmeh02l5Q&oe=6A5115A4"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1467992020894328", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619742_1467992024227661_8934197663888657607_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RdRpcQIUJnoQ7kNvwGIX-Hp&_nc_oc=AdrTwuyFJGQgG_i1hjkEThchn73qTTwjnYoK9kamC8k0EoczSoSKrkyfu_B0oEyWhy4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDILELv_2T5pJlTYe2I8c9YmLHHn1Fy-1fzwZvvtaEMnQ&oe=6A50F2C0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Bending Champions", "keywords": ["avatar", "element", "fight", "free", "multiplayer"], "long_description": "# Choose an element, battle others, become a bending champion.\nIn Bending Champions you must strike martial art poses to bend the elements. A magic system that is both rewarding and difficult to master. Fight other players to earn currency to spend on unlocking cosmetics and customizing your avatar.\n\n# Fight others\n- **1v1 duels** for pure skill\n- **2v2 and 3v3 team fights** for the power of friendship\n- **1v1v1v1** for an all out brawl\n# Choose your playstyle\n- **Earth:** Defensive and slower, but hard hitting\n- **Water:** Rapid fire and buildup\n- **Fire:** High damage and targeting\n- **Air:** Low damage but high mobility and knockback", "short_description": "A VR multiplayer arena fighter where you master elementa